{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──想要結合，但沒有順利實現的我們。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，現在是「還在結合中途」的我們。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "週末結束的星期一，天空下起了雨。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊！」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2731", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理突然發出驚呼。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連忙放下原本伸到嘴邊的手指。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了嗎？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "ag0562", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼都沒有、什什什麼都沒有！」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2732", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘴邊……嗶嗶♪安潔知道了～」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "ag0563", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是想起昨天在路邊的那個了吧？呵呼呼～愛理同學真是的～」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "ag0564", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不是的！不是那樣！」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2733", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「臉都紅了喔～吶～新吾同學，很口愛對吧～」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "ag0565", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同學轉身背對了！昨天明明還故意讓安潔看的！」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "ag0566", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……呃，因為愛理會把手放到嘴邊，絕對不是因為安潔說的路邊接吻的事。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而是比接吻更厲害的，昨晚的事。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在結合的中途……", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總﹑總而言之！！」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2734", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才討論到一半而已吧！下週的星期一開始就要期末考試了！」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2735", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔！一直都故意不去想的說！」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "ag0567", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊啊愛理同學、愛理同學～請救救安潔，考試要來了～」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "ag0568", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果有空哭喊的話就把時間拿來念書。念書的方法之前教過妳了吧？」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2736", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該、該做的事情要確實做好。對吧？新、新吾。」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2737", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也是啦……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我紅著臉回應愛理。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "考試期間真的快到了。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，又是考試喔……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "sn0195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺不久前才終於考完期中的說～時間一下子就過去了。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 337, "voice": "ht0228", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的天氣是雨天，教室內同樣也一片愁雲慘霧。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "臨近考試，愛理果然像往常那樣認真。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「影印這樣就好了。接下來是製作進度表然後……（喃喃自語）」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2738", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她非常重視而且積極地做準備，用最佳狀態開始用功念書。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你陪我，新吾。」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2739", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會，只是小事，隨時都可以。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那還可以再一件事嗎？我想去福利社買筆記本。」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2740", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……結女的福利社不是很貴嗎？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是在學校用的。在家裡我就用傳單的空白背面。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2741", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之……就是這樣，走，快點去吧！」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2742", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，愛理。又跟小新吾在一起啊。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "rk0217", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也有好好念書！還做了讀書計畫，沒有鬆懈！！」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2743", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為對學園長那樣說了，所以回到家後她換上便服，立刻開始念書。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2744", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，如果有不懂的地方就問我喔。」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2745", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使是跟我說話，她的眼神也沒有離開手邊。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然我也是為了考試在用功……", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過從她的一舉一動中可以感受到，年級第一原來是這種感覺啊。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……唔唔……快想愛理、快想！不能在這種問題花這麼多時間、嗯嗯嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2746", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2747", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好……好下一題……再２０頁、２０頁……！」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2748", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──呃，或許該說氣勢多少有點可怕才對，現在的愛理。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為了達成事前訂下的讀書計畫，她正全神貫注地翻動書頁。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後……", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天的進度結束！！」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "幾乎和轉到１０點的指針同步達標，她放下自動鉛筆。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好驚人的氣勢喔……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟我今天念的份量完全不同。當然，吸收的程度也一定不一樣吧。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已經決定今天１０點前要念到這個進度了。」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「決定好的事情就要確實做好。早上也跟安潔這樣說過了。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾念完了嗎？」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，多虧了妳我的進度也前進很多。……雖然跟愛理的程度不同。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟新吾的目標名次不同嘛。訂好時間、集中精神，能達成的話就沒有問題了。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，那個……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2755", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理在我的身旁坐下。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的臉越來越紅，手握成拳抵在嘴巴旁邊，磨磨蹭蹭的。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該做的事，都確實做好了，那個……新、吾……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2756", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、嗯……」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的表情讓我心跳加速，我點了點頭。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──考試就快到了。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想結合，但是不順利，所以，還在結合中途的我們。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在震耳欲聾的心跳聲中，唇與唇漸漸貼近……", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還有一件、要做的事……」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar2757", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是被催促般，進行了該做的事情。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
